---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import logo from '../assets/logo.png'
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container footer-grid">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <a href="/" class="footer-logo">
        <Image src={logo} alt="CodeY" width="28" height="28" />
        <span>CodeY</span>
      </a>
      <p>具备持久化执行、显式权限控制与可复用运行时的本地 AI Agent 桌面工作台。</p>
    </div>
    <nav class="footer-col" aria-label="文档">
      <h4>文档</h4>
      <a href="/docs/intro/">什么是 CodeY</a>
      <a href="/docs/getting-started/">快速开始</a>
      <a href="/docs/architecture/">架构</a>
      <a href="/docs/sdk/overview/">Agent Runtime SDK</a>
    </nav>
    <nav class="footer-col" aria-label="社区">
      <h4>社区</h4>
      <a href="https://github.com/ysmjjsy/CodeY" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/ysmjjsy/CodeY/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Issues</a>
      <a href="/docs/contributing/">参与贡献</a>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/ysmjjsy/CodeY/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener">行为准则</a
      >
    </nav>
    <nav class="footer-col" aria-label="更多">
      <h4>更多</h4>
      <a href="/docs/support/">支持与安全策略</a>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/ysmjjsy/CodeY/blob/main/LICENSE"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener">Apache-2.0 许可证</a
      >
    </nav>
  </div>
  <div class="container footer-bottom">
    <span>© 2026 CodeY contributors · Apache License 2.0</span>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    padding-top: 64px;
  }

  .footer-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.4fr) repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 48px;
    padding-bottom: 56px;
  }

  .footer-logo {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .footer-logo img {
    border-radius: 7px;
  }

  .footer-brand p {
    color: var(--fg-faint);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    max-width: 30em;
    margin: 16px 0 0;
  }

  .footer-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .footer-col h4 {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--fg);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .footer-col a {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    transition: color 0.15s;
  }

  .footer-col a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-bright);
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-block: 24px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--fg-faint);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .footer-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .footer-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }
  }
</style>
